                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear Colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 64-year-old male patient, admitted on 30/11/2020 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection presenting as moderate-to-severe COVID-19 pneumonia. On admission, chest X-ray and CT thorax confirmed bilateral infiltrates. Blood tests, arterial blood gases, and continuous pulse oximetry indicated significant hypoxaemia. The patient was commenced on supplemental oxygen therapy, dexamethasone, and anticoagulation. Remdesivir was administered per current protocol. Physiotherapy and respiratory therapy supported recovery. Clinical progress was satisfactory, with improving oxygenation and inflammatory markers. The patient is discharged in recovering condition with follow-up arranged. Please ensure continuation of thromboprophylaxis and gradual mobilisation at home. Isolation guidance and post-COVID follow-up have been discussed with the patient. Yours sincerely, Dr. [Treating Physician], Internal Medicine</div>
               </text>
